
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#090914">
  <meta name="description" content="Découvrez Neon Downloader pour Android.">
  <title>Neon Downloader — Android</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #f6f4ff;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #252052, #090914 65%);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    main { max-width: 680px; text-align: center; }
    .logo {
      width: 88px; height: 88px; margin: 0 auto 24px;
      display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 24px;
      font-size: 42px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #06b6d4);
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px #7c3aed55;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 58px); margin: 0; }
    h1 span { color: #a78bfa; }
    p { color: #c8c5dd; line-height: 1.7; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; padding: 15px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px; background: #8b5cf6; color: white;
      text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;
    }
    footer { margin-top: 48px; color: #9691b2; font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="logo">N</div>
    <h1>Neon <span>Downloader</span></h1>
    <p>
      Une interface simple et moderne pour Android.
      Retrouvez ici les informations de l’application
      et les versions disponibles.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="#telechargement">Télécharger pour Android</a>
    <p id="telechargement">
      La version APK sera disponible ici après sa publication.
    </p>
    <footer>© 2026 Neon Downloader</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
